"P2","title":"P2 · 法兰马戏团团长","text":"Lv1: “让我们为观众献上其他地方绝对看不到的精彩表演吧！各位，跟我一起来！”科迪减少30%自身承受伤害（无法被解除）。\nLv2: 第1回合开始时，科迪额外获得攻击力×500%的「护盾」，效果持续4回合（无法被解除）。\nLv3: 承受伤害降幅提升为60%。","cooldown":null},{"key":"W","title":"专武技能效果","text":"Lv1: 强化奏乐，开场！，攻击目标增加为3名随机敌人。\nLv2: 战斗开始时，科迪使忧蓝属性的全体友军获得2层「多重屏障」（无法被解除）。当技能目标受到最大生命值×10%以上的伤害时，消耗1层屏障来抵消该伤害。\nLv3: 强化星速快感，造成的物理伤害提升为攻击力×1180%。"},{"key":"stats","title":"基础资料与最高阶段专武属性","text":"基础速度 2662\nLR 大欢乐秀\n攻击力 +18%\n暴击 +10%\n力量 +8%"}],"tags":[{"key":"attack","evidence":["P1"]},{"key":"reduction","evidence":["P2"]},{"key":"shield","evidence":["P2"]},{"key":"cleanse","evidence":["P1"]},{"key":"barrier","evidence":["W"]}],"quantitative":{"survival":{"version":"survival-reference-v1","reviewedAt":"2026-09-07","note":"500%攻击盾与60%减伤相乘；自身忧蓝另有两层条件屏障，独立保留次数价值。","assumptions":[{"key":"pressure","label":"高增伤／低防御参照","defenseRatio":0.25,"damageBonus":1,"attackToHp":0.25},{"key":"reference","label":"中性参照","defenseRatio":1,"damageBonus":0.5,"attackToHp":0.3333333333333333},{"key":"favorable","label":"低增伤／高防御参照","defenseRatio":4,"damageBonus":0,"attackToHp":0.5}],"states":[{"label":"首回合护盾后，不计屏障","effects":{"shieldAttack":5,"reduction":0.6},"evidence":["P2"],"comparisons":[{"scenario":"pressure","physical":{"factors":{"hp":1,"defense":1,"specificDefense":1,"damage":1.4285714285714286,"block":1,"shield":1.25},"withoutShield":1.4285714285714286,"withShield":3.2142857142857144},"magic":{"factors":{"hp":1,"defense":1,"specificDefense":1,"damage":1.4285714285714286,"block":1,"shield":1.25},"withoutShield":1.4285714285714286,"withShield":3.2142857142857144}},{"scenario":"reference","physical":{"factors":{"hp":1,"defense":1,"specificDefense":1,"damage":1.6666666666666665,"block":1,"shield":1.6666666666666665},"withoutShield":1.6666666666666665,"withShield":4.444444444444444},"magic":{"factors":{"hp":1,"defense":1,"specificDefense":1,"damage":1.6666666666666665,"block":1,"shield":1.6666666666666665},"withoutShield":1.6666666666666665,"withShield":4.444444444444444}},{